or and connect cleanup to ownership/linear lifetime rules; retain the underlying island and operation in audit/package/release artifacts. Emit wrapper/island/precondition/proof-or-runtime-check/cleanup links under the actual profile/target and review policy. Exercise accepted wrappers and invalid-input, leaked-raw-authority, missing-precondition, unchecked-failure and lost-cleanup refusals with SAFE6-MISSING-BOUNDARY and applicable owning safety diagnostics. A wrapper label, certificate for another subject or reviewed unsafe implementation alone confers no safe API. Consume actual type/ownership/effect/grant facts and GOV9 review where required, as interface artifacts rather than whole-component completion."},
