upplies Actual typed core, ownership/layout and source-origin facts; effects/current-evidence-and-remaining-work/effects5-integrate-checked-core-consumers supplies Actual propagated effects and required capability facts; no whole-component completion prerequisite. Whole shared-facet entailment and implementation acceptance are not conferred. Allocation interface/safety/safe16/profile-matrix (Open). Role: legality compile-time safety/conformance checker. Input: claimed-profile safety corpus, actual compiler diagnostics/artifacts and target execution or explicit unavailable status. Required positive predicate: Run representative fixtures with declared accept/reject/narrow/delegate outcomes across the stated profile matrix, treating workflow as distributed plus facets/target/artifacts rather than a separate profile. Positive output witness: Declared representative core/hosted/native/firmware/kernel/hardware/distributed/AI/meta matrix and unavailable-profile results. Concrete negative case: A fixture accepted under hosted assumptions is counted as portable/native/hardware conformance without its declared narrow/delegate/reject result. Required refusal: this counterexample must not be accepted as ordinary safe behavior; retain only the governing proven-safe/runtime-checked/rejected/explicit-audited-unsafe alternatives and actual mode/profile exceptions. Evidence: inspect these actual output records and owning diagnostic IDs/source or generated-origin spans; record failed/unavailable/unrun cases, never turn a source fixture or manifest flag into execution acceptance. Dependencies: types/current-evidence-and-remaining-work/types5-integrate-typed-core supplies Actual typed core, ownership/layout and source-origin facts; effects/current-evidence-and-remaining-work/effects5-integrate-checked-core-consumers supplies Actual propagated effects and required capability facts; no whole-component completion prerequisite. Whole shared-facet entailment and implementation acceptance ar