s, no-change outcomes, missing decision records, unreproducible inputs and lost-fact/proof cases; emit PERF6 decision/safety/repro diagnostics with actual pass and source/artifact identity. PERF7 tuning reproducibility: reproduce candidate expansion, benchmark comparisons and chosen/rejected selection from pinned candidate-space/objective/constraints, source/MIR, compiler/backend, target fingerprint, benchmark data, exploration random seeds when used and provider versions. Emit candidate/selection certificate and reproducibility record, with all chosen guards/certificates and dispatch overhead bound to the claim. Release policy explicitly pins results or permits rerunning the declared tuning inputs; reject unreproducible/unpinned selection, missing target/benchmark/certificate or changed input reuse. Exercise identical-input reproduction, every identity/seed drift, stricter-safe slower selection and pinned release replay, producing PERF7 selection/certificate/repro diagnostics."},
