uts under their stated contracts; no whole-component completion prerequisite. Status: Open; implementation acceptance unassessed. Criterion `domain/firmware-sensor-integration`: Execute the declared timer-driven sensor firmware slice and reject forbidden MMIO/interrupt/runtime use. Accepted fixture: Run timer-driven sensor reset, interrupt acknowledgement, ADC schema, static buffer writes and panic behavior on a named substrate. Negative fixture: Reject forbidden MMIO/interrupt/runtime use and undeclared effects or allocation policy. Required evidence: sensor firmware image, vector/link records and simulator trace; bind source/compiler/profile/target/provider identities, source-mapped stable diagnostics and every applicable source facet field/exception/negative condition listed for this criterion in specs/requirement-reconciliation/domain-gap-completion.edn. Dependencies consume backend-c, runtime/remaining-tasks-and-evidence/implement-explicit-family-selection-and-no-runtime-rejection outputs under their stated contracts; no whole-component completion prerequisite. Status: Open; implementation acceptance unassessed.\n\nSource basis: [Firmware contract](../../docs/phase-09-domain-specific-computing-coverage/125-dom2-firmware-and-embedded-domain-specification.md)"},
