lity/render shape and metadata with no actual component consumer. Required outputs: Typed component artifacts and snapshot/interaction/target-accessibility consumer fixtures. Bind exact source/compiler/profile/target and actual API/provider/artifact identities; exercise accepted and rejected cases under the attached source conditions. Status Open; no execution acceptance is inferred. Decision criterion interface/stdlib/ui/route-contract: Validate route parameter schemas and declared navigation effects and produce route/navigation metadata. Negative fixtures: Reject invalid route parameter schemas, hidden navigation effects or missing route/navigation metadata. Required outputs: Typed route/navigation artifacts and accepted/invalid-parameter/effect fixtures. Bind exact source/compiler/profile/target and actual API/provider/artifact identities; exercise accepted and rejected cases under the attached source conditions. Status Open; no execution acceptance is inferred. Decision criterion interface/stdlib/ui/style-artifacts: Preserve deterministic styling tokens or explicit target-specific delegation records. Negative fixtures: Reject unstable styling tokens, hidden host variation or missing explicit target-delegation identity. Required outputs: Deterministic token artifacts or versioned target-delegation records with comparison/refusal fixtures. Bind exact source/compiler/profile/target and actual API/provider/artifact identities; exercise accepted and rejected cases under the attached source conditions. Status Open; no execution acceptance is inferred."},
