acet/ai-build-tools/t10/1373-1453: - IR diffs MUST distinguish semantic changes from formatting or id renumbering. ; artifact-schema facet/ai-build-tools/t10/2200-2221: - pass diff reports; ; negative-acceptance facet/ai-build-tools/t10/2648-2731: - Reject optimization diffs without preservation evidence when checks are removed. ; acceptance-fixture facet/ai-build-tools/t10/3352-3402: - IR diffs ignore stable nonsemantic renumbering. Produce actual service evidence and owning rejection diagnostics for the applicable positive/negative cases; links, record flags and another service's success do not establish this behavior. Implementation remains Open."},
